### Calculator backend API request collection
###
### Runnable from VS Code (REST Client), IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client) or JetBrains Gateway.
### Start the service first:  java -jar target/calculator-backend-1.0.0.jar
###
### Each block is separated by "###" and can be executed individually.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@json = application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Health check
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Function 1 - basic calculation
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 12 + 8 = 20
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "12+8"
}

### 9 - 4 = 5
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "9-4"
}

### 6 × 7 = 42  (the front end displays "×", the API also accepts it)
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "6×7"
}

### 20 ÷ 4 = 5
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "20/4"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Function 2 - compound expressions
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### operator precedence: 1 + 2 * 3 = 7
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "1+2*3"
}

### parentheses: (1 + 2) * 3 = 9
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "(1+2)*3"
}

### mixed: 10 / 2 + 7 = 12
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "10/2+7"
}

### unary minus: -5 + 8 = 3
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "-5+8"
}

### unary minus after an operator: 3 * -2 = -6
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "3*-2"
}

### decimals: 0.1 + 0.2 = 0.3 (exact decimal arithmetic)
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "0.1+0.2"
}

### decimals: 1.5 + 2.25 = 3.75
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "1.5+2.25"
}

### decimals: 7 / 2 = 3.5
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "7/2"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Exception handling
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### division by zero -> 400 DIVISION_BY_ZERO
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "1/0"
}

### division by zero through an expression -> 400 DIVISION_BY_ZERO
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "5/(3-3)"
}

### malformed expression -> 400 INVALID_EXPRESSION
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "1+*2"
}

### missing closing parenthesis -> 400 INVALID_EXPRESSION
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "(1+2"
}

### unsupported character -> 400 INVALID_EXPRESSION
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "1+2@3"
}

### empty expression -> 400 EMPTY_EXPRESSION
POST {{host}}/api/calculate
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "expression": "   "
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Function 3 - calculation history
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### the whole history, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/history

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Function 4 - delete history
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### delete one record; replace 1 with an id returned by the history request above
DELETE {{host}}/api/history/1

### deleting an unknown id -> 404 NOT_FOUND
DELETE {{host}}/api/history/999999
